  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>The rules text is copyrighted and not included (not in the SRD): copy it from the Absorb Elements spell in Xanathar's Guide to Everything into this description.</em></p><p><em>midi-qol: Cast as a reaction when you take acid, cold, fire, lightning or thunder damage: you choose the element, have resistance to it until the start of your next turn, and your first melee hit on your next turn deals the extra damage of that element (more from a higher slot).</em></p>",
